    "description": "<p><strong>Standard</strong>: You maneuver the vehicle. The vehicle's Evasion equals your Evasion, adjusted by vehicle-specific modifiers. If there are multiple pilots, use the highest Evasion among them.</p><p><strong>Dedicated</strong>: Gain +1 to <strong>Agility</strong> or <strong>Finesse</strong> <strong>Rolls</strong> made while piloting the vehicle. You may change this choice on a rest. If there are two Dedicated Pilots, both gain this bonus.</p>",
